    "answer": {
      "short": "$16$\n\nRewrite the expression as $(x+2)^8$, then extract the coefficient of $x^7$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x^2+4x+4)^4&=\\bigl((x+2)^2\\bigr)^4\\\\(x^2+4x+4)^4&=(x+2)^8\\\\T_k&=\\binom{8}{k}x^{8-k}2^k.\\end{align*}$$\nFor the $x^7$ term, $8-k=7$, so $k=1$. The coefficient is\n$$\\binom{8}{1}2=16.$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
